        "html": "<p><b>Parrots in Australia</b></p><p>There are 345 varieties of parrot in existence and, of these, [[23]] live in Australia. As early as the [[24]], the mapmaker [[25]] recognized that parrots lived in that part of the world. [[26]], the famous painter of animals and birds, commented on the size and beauty of the Australian parrot family.</p>"
