        "html": "<p><b>Data on food deserts and their effects on health</b></p><p><b>The Brooklyn Food Association</b></p><ul><li>The online map provides users with a store's name, [[1]] and details of its produce</li><li>One goal of the mapping project is to help develop new [[2]] on food.</li><li>Citizen maps are sometimes made when [[3]] maps are unsatisfactory.</li></ul><p><b>Reasons for the development of food deserts</b></p><ul><li>New research suggests that people living in food deserts often have low [[4]]</li><li>Some supermarkets are unable to buy enough [[5]] inside cities for their stores</li><li>Small grocery stores in cities often cannot cope with supermarket [[6]]</li></ul>"
